  Name: The Hanged Man
  text: " The card swings silently in your hand, heavy with doom and the weight of
    choices unmade.  $ Its image twists time and fate, showing sacrifice, suffering,
    and consequences that cannot be avoided.  $The Hand of the King has discovered
    the truth. $The Fool is caught. His laughter silenced, the spark of rebellion
    extinguished. The princess and the guard remain, trembling under the Hand\u2019s
    wrath, but alive\u2014haunted by what might have been."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e97bcc33d5452acd9a845ed6a0b8654, type: 3}
